{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi3PJEgC7XwAqXCoYZPW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"97 pass and 15 fail. The remaining failures fall into three groups:\n\n- **Touch test and sin bin:** test-setup issues. A player picks up the ball near the touchline, and the sin-bin clock only runs in play.\n- **Penalty:** a real gap in the test. A penalty against the human side waits on the menu, and the autopilot never picks an option.\n- **Cup save:** the cup record never advances after a won match. This is the one real bug, so I'll reproduce it before changing anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":424039,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":856},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f6aeda2-f9ed-42d4-a150-3a2efde4ea9e","uuid":"8a6b19c0-7a8b-4832-bb8f-729e3d4bec42","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:25:38.464Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi3PHr7KmcrxZZgfB8H5"}
