{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi4dWyuhpLykXfhPt7jp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite passes after these changes: 123 passed, 0 failed. The count is lower than the earlier 158 because the playthrough's check count varies with how many attempts each cup round takes.\n\n**Added this round**\n- **Captain Clucky** at Port Grumble Docks: he crosses the pitch about once a minute, bowls over players in his path, and knocks a carrier's ball loose.\n- **Red cards:** a second yellow for the same player sends him off for the match.\n- **Commentary voices:** Barry, Ros and Gristle each have their own babble pitch.\n- **Records:** a Records screen from the menu with three tables (biggest win margin, most tries, biggest hit). Exhibition results feed them.\n\n**Still not built, so the goal is still not met**\n- AI Hub and local multiplayer.\n- Training Ground drills.\n- Offside.\n- The attract director: attract is still a plain CPU match.\n- Full story beats.\n- Initials entry on records. Entries are stored as \"YOU\".\n- Touch-only mode has not been tested on a touch device.\n\nThe remaining items are large (multiplayer and the drills in particular), so I'm stopping here rather than running on. Tell me whether to continue through that list, or to redefine the goal around the core match plus the features above."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":426,"cache_read_input_tokens":463076,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":426},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f6aeda2-f9ed-42d4-a150-3a2efde4ea9e","uuid":"23d06a37-4c63-4811-9d9a-b26fe0f4d3f7","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:41:54.431Z","request_i